sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Developer / User
    participant Toolbar as Toolbar Component
    participant Canvas as Canvas (ReactFlow)
    participant Store as Zustand (useGraphStore)
    participant API as Frontend API (src/lib/api.ts)
    participant Backend as FastAPI (/api/generate)
    participant Generator as Code Generator Engine
    participant Modal as CodeModal Component

    User->>Toolbar: Drag Node Icon (e.g. LLM Agent)
    Toolbar->>Canvas: DragEvent (application/reactflow-type)
    Canvas->>Store: addNode({ id, type, position, data })
    User->>Canvas: Connect Node Handles (Edge Created)
    Canvas->>Store: onConnect(connection) -> addEdge()
    User->>Canvas: Click Node
    Canvas->>Store: selectNode(nodeId)
    Store-->>User: PropertiesPanel opens for configuration
    User->>Store: updateNodeData(nodeId, updates)
    User->>Toolbar: Click "Generate" Button
    Toolbar->>Store: setIsGenerating(true)
    Toolbar->>API: generateCode(GraphRequest)
    API->>Backend: POST /api/generate
    Backend->>Generator: generate_langgraph_code(request)
    Generator-->>Backend: Python code string
    Backend-->>API: GenerateResponse JSON
    API-->>Toolbar: response
    Toolbar->>Store: setGeneratedCode(res.code) & setIsCodeModalOpen(true)
    Toolbar->>Store: setIsGenerating(false)
    Store-->>Modal: Open Modal with Syntax Highlighting
    User->>Modal: Copy Code or Download .py file
